$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Mud" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear summer night sky" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName1> and <vServer::teamName0> must find some way to get to each others flags floating way up high in the sky. Some may use the shooter and others may try to fly. I recomend the shooter. But be careful, it can be tricky. Just run straight down the shooter and then when it starts to take you just stear. Stay away from the edges." @
         "\n\n<f1>Map engineered and designed by:<f0> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)" @
         "\n<f2>You can find this map at Planetstarsiege.com/extreme";
